OL,3,GNEWSA'I've got my son back' - mum      
OL,4,Apraises youth service                  
OL,6,FA mother said her autistic son had been
OL,7,Fbrought back from "regularly not       
OL,8,Fwanting to be alive" through the help  
OL,9,Fof a youth organisation.               
OL,11,FApollo holds one-to-one mentoring and  
OL,12,Fworkshops to help young people in      
OL,13,FGuernsey who have struggled in         
OL,14,Fmainstream systems.                    
OL,16,FAnna said she had previously tried to  
OL,17,Ffind help for her son "through school  
OL,18,Fand social services" but they had not  
OL,19,Fbeen right for him. "There are so many 
OL,20,Fconstraints that those organisations   
OL,21,Fhave as to what they can and can't do",
OL,22,Fshe said.                              
